efault-avatar-2020-1.jpg", "contribution_count": 47, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 503960, "location_name": "Melton Mowbray", "location_name_detailed": "Melton Mowbray, United Kingdom"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-10-15", "published_at_date": "2019-10-15"}, {"review_id": 718136773, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r718136773-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "A religious culture shock", "text": "Travelling here as a group, and you're quite protected from being hassled by hawkers. Once you understand and respect the religious importance of this place and the process, it's 'not quite' as confronting. We were amazed how many locals just came here to sit and watch the cremations, I think this also helps accept what you witness.\nEven though I went here, I wouldn't have thought I'd missed out if I hadn't seen it.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2019-09-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "E9965029D02E3D6F8FD733D17FBE5F77", "name": "Tim D", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/timd655", "username": "timd655", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/e2/a7/default-avatar-2020-44.jpg", "contribution_count": 159, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 255361, "location_name": "Swan Hill", "location_name_detailed": "Swan Hill, Australia"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": ["https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/19/9f/9e/36/pashupatinath-temple.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/19/9f/9e/66/pashupatinath-temple.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/19/9f/9f/03/pashupatinath-temple.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/19/9f/9f/7b/pashupatinath-temple.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/19/9f/9f/90/pashupatinath-temple.jpg"], "created_at_date": "2019-10-14", "published_at_date": "2019-10-14"}, {"review_id": 717639928, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r717639928-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Different", "text": "At this place people are cremated. Entrance fee for foreigners Rs 1000. Here you can watch how loved ones cremate there family members. This all happens on the other side of the small river. Still having a good view. Lots of people trying to be your guide or sell stuff. 50 people are cremated here every day. Interesting to see.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2019-09-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "CAE539DAEACFF773CC7E83C530FC6298", "name": "Rogier K", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/rogierk2015", "username": "rogierk2015", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/0d/05/bd/a6/rogier-k.jpg", "contribution_count": 113, "hometown": null, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-10-12", "published_at_date": "2019-10-12"}, {"review_id": 717467121, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r717467121-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Cultural and heritage event", "text": "You need time to understand the complex religious significance of this place. Get a good guide in your own language who can give an unbiased explanation of the Hindu and Buddhist aspects in play here! Don't forget to watch the locals and domestic tourists in this place.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is